graph TB
    %% Main components
    A[User/Client] -->|Deposit Request| B[API Layer]
    B -->|Route Request| C[API Handler]
    C -->|Process Deposit| D[Bridge Service]
    
    %% Event listener flow
    E[Blockchain Event Listener] -->|Listen for Deposits| F[Deposit Event]
    F -->|Queue for Processing| D
    
    %% Bridge service subprocesses
    D -->|Record in DB| G[Database]
    D -->|Submit Tasks| H[Worker Manager]
    
    %% Worker pools
    H -->|Deposit Tasks| I[Deposit Worker Pool]
    H -->|Calculation Tasks| J[Calculation Worker Pool]
    H -->|Distribution Tasks| K[Distribution Worker Pool]
    H -->|Database Tasks| L[Database Worker Pool]
    
    %% Processing flow
    D -->|Process Deposit| M[Validate Deposit]
    M -->|If Valid| N[Calculate MON Amount]
    N -->|Submit for Distribution| O[Batch Distributor]
    O -->|Mint Tokens| P[Blockchain Transaction]
    P -->|Update Status| G
    
    %% Error handling
    M -->|If Invalid| Q[Queue Refund]
    Q -->|Process Refund| R[Refund Process]
    R -->|Update Status| G
    
    %% Monitoring and recovery
    D -->|Monitor System| S[System Monitor]
    D -->|Recover Stuck Txs| T[Recovery Process]
    
    %% Bridges between chains
    P -->|Send to| U[Arbitrum Network]
    P -->|Distribute on| V[Monad Network]
    
    %% Status checking
    A -->|Check Status| W[TX Status API]
    W -->|Query| G
    
    %% Subgraph for worker pools
    subgraph "Worker Pools"
        I
        J
        K
        L
    end
    
    %% Subgraph for blockchain networks
    subgraph "Blockchain Networks"
        U
        V
    end
    
    %% Subgraph for error handling
    subgraph "Error Handling"
        Q
        R
        T
    end
    
    %% Bridge service components
    subgraph "Bridge Service"
        D
        M
        N
        O
        S
    end